# Cross-origin isolation for multithreaded WebAssembly (wllama, ONNX Runtime Web).
# "credentialless" lets the page fetch models from Hugging Face's CDN without that CDN
# sending Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy headers. Netlify and Cloudflare Pages read this file.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
